[00:15.74]1. Look around us now;
[00:18.50]See the love on each face—
[00:22.34]Out there in the world, hard to find.
[00:29.00]All these faithful friends
[00:31.82]With the love they all show,
[00:35.72]Glad to leave that old world behind.
[00:44.30](Pre-Chorus)
[00:44.30]Love never fails; that’s promised.
[00:49.46]It always will endure.
[00:57.44](Chorus)
[00:57.84]Love—unfailing love—
[01:02.08]That’s what Jehovah gives.
[01:06.44]That’s what he is.
[01:11.00]Love—unfailing love—
[01:15.86]That’s what we need to live.
[01:20.04]And the love here today,
[01:23.30]In our heart may it stay—
[01:31.62]Unfailing love.
[01:39.02]2. Though sometimes it seems
[01:42.52]Like the cares of this life
[01:46.20]Weigh us down and feel hard to bear,
[01:53.56]Giving brings us joy
[01:56.04]When we share faith and hope,
[01:59.96]Comforted by God’s loving care.
[02:05.14](Pre-Chorus)
[02:08.32]Love will remain; that’s promised.
[02:13.68]It always will endure.
[02:20.38](Chorus)
[02:21.56]Love—unfailing love—
[02:26.18]That’s what Jehovah gives.
[02:30.52]That’s what he is.
[02:35.32]Love—unfailing love—
[02:39.80]That’s what we need to live.
[02:44.04]And the love here today,
[02:47.54]In our heart may it stay.
[02:57.46](Chorus)
[02:57.94]Love—unfailing love—
[03:02.12]That’s what Jehovah gives.
[03:06.56]That’s what he is.
[03:09.96]Love—unfailing love—
[03:15.84]That’s what we need to live.
[03:20.12]And the love here today,
[03:23.34]In our heart may it stay—
[03:31.50]Unfailing love,
[03:37.56]Unfailing love,
[03:47.80]Unfailing love.
